==Russian==
{{wp|ru:}}
[[Image:Bogaevsky Morning.jpg|thumb|''{{lang|ru|У́тро}}'' (1910), [[w:Konstantin Bogaevsky|{{lang|ru|Константи́н Богаевский}}]]]]

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*(j)utro||morning, dawn}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|у́тро}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-утро.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|a,e|у́тро|gen_sg=у́тра,утра́|dat_sg=у́тру,утру́|gen_pl=у́тр|*|adj=у́тренний|dim=у́тречко,утрецо́}}

# [[morning]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''у́тром'''|t=in the '''morning'''}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[по]] '''утра́м'''|t='''mornings'''}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[к]] '''утру́'''|t=by '''morning'''}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[до]] '''утра́'''|t=till '''morning'''}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[с]] '''утра́'''|t=from '''morning'''}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[от]] '''утра́'''|t=from '''morning'''}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[от]] '''утра́''' [[до]] '''утра́'''|t=from '''morning''' to '''morning'''}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[де́сять]] [[час|часо́в]] '''утра́'''|t=10:00 '''a.m.'''}}

====Usage notes====
* Normally the stress falls on the first syllable, but in many set phrases with prepositions, the stress is shifted to the case ending.

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|a,e|у́тро|gen_sg=у́тра,утра́*|dat_sg=у́тру,утру́*|pre_pl=у́трах|dat_pl_tail=*|ins_pl_tail=*|notes=* Used in the meaning "in/by/from/etc. the morning time".}}
{{ru-noun-table|a,e|у́тро|gen_sg=у́тра,утра́*|dat_sg=у́тру,утру́*|pre_pl=у́трахъ|dat_pl_tail=*|ins_pl_tail=*|notes=* Used in the meaning "in/by/from/etc. the morning time".|old=1}}

